  {
   "description": "Who processed this W-4 for the employer. Taken from the authorized signer roster in I-9 Settings where one is configured; the calling account's own name otherwise. THE EMPLOYER'S NAME, ADDRESS AND EIN ARE NOT COLUMNS HERE — they are resolved at render time from I-9 Settings or the Company, so a farm that changes its registered address does not have a hundred W-4 rows carrying the old one.",
